+### 25. Clickbait Setup Phrases
+
+**Words to watch:** Here's why, Here's the thing, Here's what you need to know, The reason is simple, What does this mean?, So what's the takeaway?
+
+**Problem:** LLMs front-load explanations with rhetorical questions or "reveal" phrases that delay substance.
+
+**Before:**
+> Here's why this matters: the API processes requests asynchronously. Here's the thing—most developers don't realize this until they hit race conditions.
+
+**After:**
+> The API processes requests asynchronously, which can cause race conditions if you assume synchronous behavior.
+
+---
+
+### 26. Forced Enthusiasm
+
+**Words to watch:** Let's dive in, Excited to share, Can't wait to show you, Let's get started, Without further ado, Let's jump right in, Ready? Let's go
+
+**Problem:** LLMs inject performative energy that reads as hollow, especially in technical writing.
+
+**Before:**
+> Excited to share our new authentication system! Let's dive in and explore how it works. Ready? Let's get started!
+
+**After:**
+> The new authentication system uses JWT tokens with a 15-minute expiry.
+
+---
